College Network System – Cisco Packet Tracer

A multi-department college campus network designed and simulated in Cisco Packet Tracer 9.0. Four department LANs (Admin, Computer Lab, Library, Staff) connect through a central switch to a server router, using per-department subnets, DHCP and inter-department routing.

Project file: colege-system.pkt (open with Cisco Packet Tracer 8.x / 9.x)

